abstract: "A reusable analysis framework and writing style tool based on Charlie Munger's public methodology, including the Latticework of Mental Models, Inversion, Circle of Competence, Margin of Safety, Lollapalooza Effect, and 25 Cognitive Biases. Designed to assist in investment decision analysis, business judgment, corporate quality assessment, and cognitive bias detection. This skill provides a thinking framework and writing style calibration, and does NOT claim to represent Charlie Munger personally or his unpublished views."
